00:23:51.830 --> 00:23:56.380
Ever since humans discovered microbes, we've struggled to control them, from controlled

00:23:56.380 --> 00:24:00.000
environments to prevent contamination and rot, to controlled

00:24:00.030 --> 00:24:02.470
